ey and Karrie, since it's hard for Yu Zhong to land his skills, making him a vulnerable and easy target.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"karrie\",\"heroName\":\"Karrie\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Yu Zhong is countered by nimble Marksman heroes such as Lesley and Karrie, since it's hard for Yu Zhong to land his skills, making him a vulnerable and easy target.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_97280cb443adc3bcb4ca9b36a0fada53.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9823ce4fe5eb89c0082b24f6d5ea67f6.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"96\",\"heroName\":\"Luo Yi\",\"heroSlug\":\"luo-yi\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_c9f30c0ebde489a34b70ba1064c6fb02.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Luo Yi, Angela, Estes\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"16\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_3bbb2c2b8a78d0d63ecd62d74048fcf4.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Zilong, Ling, Lancelot\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"2\",\"heroName\":\"Balmond\",\"heroSlug\":\"balmond\",\"icon\":\"https://indoch.s3.ml.moonlian.com/web/madmin/image_be884c14d560f6bc5827e2a663439f94.png\",\"tip\":\"Balmond, Ruby, Baxia\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Cursing Touch\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Yu Zhong applies Sha Residue to enemy heroes each time he damages them.\\n\\nSha Residue erupts upon reaching 5 stacks on a target. Then it begins consuming 1 stack every 0.4s to deal Physical Damage equal to 20 (+20% Extra Physical Attack) (+ 2.5% of target's lost HP) to the target. Each stack consumed recovers 6% of Yu Zhong's lost HP. Yu Zhong also gains 30% Movement Speed for 3s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yu Zhong applies \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sha Residue\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemy heroes each time he damages them.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sha Residue\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" erupts upon reaching 5 stacks on a target. Then it begins consuming 1 stack every 0.4s to deal \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" equal to 20\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+20% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 2.5% of target's lost HP) to the target. Each stack consumed recovers 6% of Yu Zhong's lost HP. Yu Zhong also gains 30% Movement Speed for 3s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_70130baa91b397c878074c763667da58.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Dragon Tail\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Yu Zhong infuses his power into his cloak and turns it into a weapon, which starts to attack nearby enemies after a short delay. The inner area of the cloak deals 220 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage, whereas the sharpened edge deals 275% damage and applies 2 stacks of Sha Residue.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yu Zhong infuses his power into his cloak and turns it into a weapon, which starts to attack nearby enemies after a short delay. The inner area of the cloak deals 220\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", whereas the sharpened edge deals 275% damage and applies 2 stacks of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sha Residue\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_059500c39711fede4fa015c651fcb1f6.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Soul Grip\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Yu Zhong unleashes the Dragon Soul, dealing 150 (+120% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to all enemies in front and slowing them by 60% for 1s.\\n\\nUpon hitting an enemy, Yu Zhong's next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 108 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. Upon hitting multiple enemies, the enhanced Basic Attack will apply multiple stacks of Sha Residue and deal up to 200% damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yu Zhong unleashes the Dragon Soul, dealing 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to all enemies in front and slowing them by 60% for 1s. \\n\\nUpon hitting an enemy, Yu Zhong's next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 108\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Upon hitting multiple enemies, the enhanced Basic Attack will apply multiple stacks of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sha Residue\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and deal up to 200% damage.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a994b7307c97f871b488e98e31eb84de.png\",\"tags\":[\"Slow\",\"Mobility\"]},{\"name\":\"Furious Dive\",\"type\":\"Skill 3\",\"description\":\"Yu Zhong leaps towards the designated area with his full strength, dealing 180 (+90% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage. He is able to dash one more time in the movement direction.\\nAfter a short delay, enemies within the area of effect will be knocked airborne for 0.6s and take 180 (+90% Extra Physical Attack) additional Physical Damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yu Zhong leaps towards the designated area with his full strength, dealing 180\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+90% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". He is able to dash one more time in the movement direction. \\nAfter a short delay, enemies within the area of effect will be knocked airborne for 0.6s and take 180\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+90% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" additional \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":\"14s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_be320a759c57e0d449adf7afe97cdbd0.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"Black Dragon Form\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"After channeling for 0.6s, Yu Zhong transforms into his Black Dragon Form. For up to 7s, he cannot use other skills but can move freely and will knock back enemy heroes in his path while dealing 180 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. He also gains 1000 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) Max HP, becomes immune to control effects, and ignores obstacles in this form.\\nUpon exiting the Black Dragon Form, Yu Zhong enters Dragonoid Form, gaining increased range on all of his skills for 10s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"After channeling for 0.6s, Yu Zhong transforms into his Black Dragon Form. For up to 7s, he cannot use other skills but can move freely and will knock back enemy heroes in his path while dealing 180\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". He also gains 1000\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+200% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Max HP, becomes immune to control effects, and ignores obstacles in this form.\\nUpon exiting the Black Dragon Form, Yu Zhong enters \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dragonoid Form\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", gaining increased range on all of his skills for 10s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"85s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_936aca894105c4c9a4ee0a7b5a472438.png\",\"tags\":[\"Morph\",\"Buff\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"4-1-3-2\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"vexana\",\"heroName\":\"Vexana\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Yu Zhong works well with Mages that can initiate with CC such as Vexana and Xavier. Their control effects allow Yu Zhong to land his skills more easily.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"xavier\",\"heroName\":\"Xavier\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Yu Zhong works well with Mages that can initiate with CC such as Vexana and Xavier. Their control effects allow Yu Zhong to land his skills more easily.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, open with Yu Zhong's Ultimate and run into the enemy's formation while knocking them around. When the enemy's backline heroes are exposed, use his Ultimate again to enter Dragonoid Form, and unleash his combo starting with his 2nd Skill then 3rd Skill, then 1st Skill to deal tons of damage. Finally, use the enhanced Basic Attack from his 2nd Skill to finish off the enemy.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":9540,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_936aca894105c4c9a4ee0a7b5a472438.png\"},{\"skillId\":9540,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_936aca894105c4c9a4ee0a7b5a472438.png\"},{\"skillId\":9520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a994b7307c97f871b488e98e31eb84de.png\"},{\"skillId\":9530,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_be320a759c57e0d449adf7afe97cdbd0.png\"},{\"skillId\":9510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_059500c39711fede4fa015c651fcb1f6.png\"},{\"skillId\":9500,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, use Yu Zhong's 2nd Skill to slow the enemy and leap on them using his 3rd Skill. When repositioning with the dash of his 3rd Skill, cast his 1st Skill to hit the enemy with the outer edge, and follow up with the enhanced Basic Attack from his 2nd Skill and finish the combo with a Sha Residue eruption.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":9520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a994b7307c97f871b488e98e31eb84de.png\"},{\"skillId\":9530,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_be320a759c57e0d449adf7afe97cdbd0.png\"},{\"skillId\":9510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_059500c39711fede4fa015c651fcb1f6.png\"},{\"skillId\":9500,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Yu Zhong build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. War Axe into Oracle power spike, stack management, and when NOT to lock the Black Dragon.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Yu Zhong wins fights that look like they're going against him. His passive converts sustained melee engagement into a regen engine: each 5-stack Sha Residue eruption deals HP-loss-based physical damage and restores a chunk of his own missing HP, which means every trade that drags on tilts in his favor. That loop is his identity, and managing it well is the entire game.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"yu-zhong\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-sustain-default\",\"name\":\"EXP Sustain Default\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"fighter\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"thrill\",\"name\":\"Thrill\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/thrill.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"festival-of-blood\",\"name\":\"Festival of Blood\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/festival-of-blood.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"war-cry\",\"name\":\"War Cry\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/war-cry.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"petrify\",\"name\":\"Petrify\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control and magic poke are not deciding the first Turtle fight.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use before true late game when movement speed, cooldown reduction, and control-duration reduction keep Sha Residue uptime higher than a revive.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy draft has regen, shields, or attack-speed carries that must hit Yu Zhong during the first dive.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when burst magic can delete Yu Zhong before Oracle and Queen's Wings can stabilize the entry.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default EXP setup for ranked games where Yu Zhong needs the War Axe, Oracle, and Queen's Wings sustain curve before chasing backline fights.\",\"totalCost\":11040,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":115,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Hunter Strike\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"physpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2650,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Oracle\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":38,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Oracle\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Hunter Strike\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=yu-zhong\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cwar-axe%2Coracle%2Cqueens-wings%2Chunter-strike%2Cimmortality\u0026spell=petrify\u0026emblem=fighter\u0026talents=thrill%2Cfestival-of-blood%2Cwar-cry\u0026flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Cbrute-force-breastplate.immortality%2Cdominance-ice.hunter-strike%2Cathenas-shield.immortality\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"anti-sustain-frontline\",\"name\":\"Anti-Sustain Frontline\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"cost\":1870,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"fighter\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"firmness\",\"name\":\"Firmness\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/firmness.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"festival-of-blood\",\"name\":\"Festival of Blood\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/festival-of-blood.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"petrify\",\"name\":\"Petrify\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when fights are still mid-game brawls and the low-HP damage reduction is worth more than late-game revive insurance.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against repeated physical skill burst from EXP fighters or assassins that meet Yu Zhong before Sha Residue erupts.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against repeated magic damage that stacks through long Turtle, Lord, or base fights.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-armor\",\"name\":\"Blade Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a basic-attack marksman is forced to hit Yu Zhong before reaching your back line.\"}],\"notes\":\"Durable EXP setup for drafts where Yu Zhong must take first contact, carry Lifebane, and survive long enough for repeated Cursing Touch eruptions.\",\"totalCost\":10660,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":8,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2650,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Oracle\",\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\