webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Yu_Zhong/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Blood Serpent\",\"tier\":\"Exquisite\",\"rawTier\":\"Exquisite\",\"tag\":\"Collector\",\"tagSlug\":\"collector\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero954-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Hero954-portrait-20260807054340.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Yu-Zhong-Blood-Serpent-20260807054629.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Yu_Zhong/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Exorcist Yu Zhong\",\"tier\":\"Grand\",\"rawTier\":\"Grand\",\"tag\":\"The Exorcists\",\"tagSlug\":\"the-exorcists\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero955-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Hero955-portrait-20220915122237.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Yu-Zhong-Exorcist-Yu-Zhong-20220915134452.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Yu_Zhong/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Dragon's Shade\",\"tier\":\"Deluxe\",\"rawTier\":\"Deluxe\",\"tag\":\"M5\",\"tagSlug\":\"m5\",\"price\":\"M5 Pass\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero957-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Hero957-portrait-20240114145027.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Yu-Zhong-Dragon-s-Shade-20231029210009.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Yu_Zhong/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Cosmic Dragon\",\"tier\":\"Grand\",\"rawTier\":\"Grand\",\"tag\":\"PRIME\",\"tagSlug\":\"prime\",\"price\":\"M5 Pass\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero958-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Hero958-portrait-20240114145030.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/yu-zhong/Yu-Zhong-Cosmic-Dragon-20231029210048.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Yu_Zhong/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Yu Zhong is the Black Dragon, an ancient Dragon Lord who once ruled the Cadia Riverlands before being sealed away by a coalition of eastern heroes. For centuries he slumbered beneath the Dragon Altar, his power slowly regenerating. When the seal weakened during the Abyssal invasion, Yu Zhong broke free, reassuming his terrifying draconic form. He now seeks to reclaim his dominion over the East, viewing all mortals as insignificant creatures beneath his notice.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"relationship\":\"Temporary alliance of dark powers seeking conquest\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"zhask\",\"heroName\":\"Zhask\",\"relationship\":\"Alien ruler who respects his ancient authority\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"relationship\":\"Dragon warrior sworn to defeat the Black Dragon\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"wanwan\",\"heroName\":\"Wanwan\",\"relationship\":\"Eastern heroine defending the Cadia Riverlands\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"relationship\":\"Moniyan captain who opposes his expansion\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Yu_Zhong\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":48.96,\"pickRate\":0.64,\"banRate\":1.42},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":48.93,\"pickRate\":0.64,\"banRate\":1.35},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":48.76,\"pickRate\":0.65,\"banRate\":1.23},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":49.51,\"pickRate\":0.56,\"banRate\":0.64},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":49.34,\"pickRate\":0.57,\"banRate\":0.65},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":49.1,\"pickRate\":0.57,\"banRate\":0.69},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":49.01,\"pickRate\":0.54,\"banRate\":0.72}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Yu Zhong\",\"heroSlug\":\"yu-zhong\",\"roles\":\"$61:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$61:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty